<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1351] Move portable API examples to Ignite</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1351</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have to open source portable API examples that are a part of GridGain for now.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The examples must be reworked/enhanced in order to use the latest portable API.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12861223">IGNITE-1351</key>
            <summary>Move portable API examples to Ignite</summary>
