                            <comment id="14727061" author="dmagda" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 09:24:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Moved, modified the examples to Ignite. Checked that they are workable, added all the examples to the examples test suite.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Will check with TC that everything works fine.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14727063" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 09:24:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user dmagda opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/57&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/57&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ignite-1351: move portable API examples&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1351&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1351&lt;/a&gt; for more info&lt;/p&gt;

