&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit ad887c16975ef4a06d19547302e455724552fe83&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Denis Magda &amp;lt;dmagda@gridgain.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
