&lt;p&gt;    ignite-1351: moved (open sourced) portable API examples from GridGain to Ignite&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14727081" author="dmagda" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 09:29:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Link to the pull-request &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/57&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/57&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14727102" author="dmagda" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 09:53:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Example tests on TC look good. Please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14728779" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2015 09:53:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Denis,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your contribution to Ignite. I think that cross-platform should be removed for now because neither C++, not .Net platforms support are expected in this release. Let&apos;s add it a bit later, once at least one platform is up and running.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14728800" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2015 10:04:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user dmagda closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/57&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/57&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14728835" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2015 10:33:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Vladimir, thanks for the review! &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve put back the cross-platform example.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Plus recreated the branch branching from ignite-1.4. Unable to recover the pull-request. So when it&apos;s time to merge the changes please get them using this command&lt;br/&gt;
git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dmagda/incubator-ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/dmagda/incubator-ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-1351&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14729064" author="yzhdanov" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2015 13:50:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please see if example-ignite-portable.xml configuration can reuse example-ignite.xml configuration and add portable specific settings&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14729087" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2015 14:01:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Introduced example-default.xml that keeps default configuration settings. This file is included in example-ignite.xml and example-ignite-portable.xml.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14729090" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2015 14:02:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to ignite-1.4. Must be back merged to master from ignite-1.4 when it&apos;s released.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
